# Gurugram Digital Twin — Environment Configuration
# All basemaps work out-of-the-box using Esri Dark Gray Canvas / OpenStreetMap (No API key required)

# Optional: If you have a CARTO basemaps API key, specify it here to use authenticated CARTO Dark Matter:
# VITE_CARTO_API_KEY=your_carto_api_key_here

# Optional: If you have a Cesium Ion token for World Terrain / 3D Tiles:
# VITE_CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=your_cesium_ion_token_here

